OFOs - Modified slightly to conform to FERC policies.
Penalties - Proposed 3 changes:  use the average weekly high or low prices instead of average monthly price for cashing out imbalances; scheduling penalty on variances between scheduled and actual receipts would not apply unless it notifies shippers 24 hours in advance of system issue; proposed expanding scheduling tolerance on receipt points to 10%.
